# Docs index

| Path | What it is | When to update |
|------|------------|----------------|
| [architecture/context.md](architecture/context.md) | System context mermaid | New actor, system, or external API |
| [architecture/runtime.md](architecture/runtime.md) | Processes and runtime | New service, worker, or queue |
| [architecture/data.md](architecture/data.md) | Data model mermaid | Models, events, or stored shapes |
| [architecture/flows/](architecture/flows/) | Sequence diagrams per use case | New product flow (new file, do not append to overview) |
| [decisions/](decisions/) | ADRs (why, frozen) | New numbered file; never rewrite old mermaid |
| [runbooks/](runbooks/) | Operate and recover | Run/deploy/incident steps |

`README.md` and `AGENTS.md` are maps. They do not host architecture diagrams.
